    <statement><p>Perform the indicated operations on the three expressions
<me>x + \frac{6}{x^{2}-36} - \frac{x^{2}}{x+6}.</me>
Express your answer in simplest form <m>\frac{A}{B}</m>.</p>
<p>Answer: <m>A =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/> and <m>B =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>6x^{2}-6^{2}x+6</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>x^{2}-6\cdot 6</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
